    "Research only: fixed one-vote subject, n=4,t=3 and same-host processes, not HotStuff/admission integration.",
    "TLS1.3 mTLS pins enrolled certificates; all-to-all authenticated DKG agreement requires all participants and can fail closed on withholding.",
